{"title":"Scroll Acid Rain","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ogre Shaman, Ogre Butcher, Gaunt Ogre</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Teaches</b> Acid Rain, a level-4 Acid spell. Needs 40 Intellect and Acid skill 25 to learn and to cast.</p><p><b>Drops from monsters that cast Acid spells, level 30+.</b></p><ul class=\"wp-list\">\n          <li>A monster that casts spells drops scrolls of its own school, so look for Acid casters.</li>\n          <li>The monster’s level picks the spell level: <b>8+</b> drops level-2 scrolls, <b>18+</b> level-3 and <b>30+</b> level-4.</li>\n          </ul>\n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - Normal, 0.2% of recorded drops (2 / 1,303 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/56cd267034ceeafbeb26.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.2%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (1 / 197 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (1 / 1,996 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"scroll-acid-rain\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/36e828d6e26df580a66e.svg\" alt=\"Scroll Acid Rain\"></div><h3>Scroll Acid Rain</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/5/2026, 7:47:58 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}